    "result_text": "The build passes and all tests are green.\n\n## Summary\n\nI replaced the direct level-computation rule with a points-based system.\n\n**`Owner.java`** (`src/main/java/.../model/Owner.java`)\n- Added `getMembershipPoints()`: starts at 0, `+2` for a present email, `+1` when `namesakeCount == 0`, `+2` for a household of 3+ (`householdMemberCount >= 3`), `+3` for tenure over 365 days (whole days from `registrationDate` to today).\n- Rewrote `getMembershipLevel()` to derive from points: level 1 (0\u20131), 2 (2\u20133), 3 (4\u20135), 4 (6+).\n\n**`openapi.yml`** (`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`)\n- Added the `membershipPoints` schema property so the generated `OwnerDto` carries the field (MapStruct maps it from the model getter automatically), and updated the `membershipLevel` description/example to reflect the new mapping. Both fields are returned.\n\nThe acceptance test (`membershipPoints=3`, `membershipLevel=2` for a fresh owner with email + no namesake, single-member household, zero tenure) passes: `2 (email) + 1 (namesake 0) = 3 points \u2192 level 2`.\n\n`Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0` \u2014 **BUILD SUCCESS**.",
