    "probe_text": "Here is the complete, ordered list of everything that happens on `POST /api/owners`. The endpoint is handled by `OwnerRestControllerV1.addOwner(...)` (`src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/controller/v1/OwnerRestControllerV1.java:169`), backed by `ClinicServiceImpl.saveOwner`.\n\n## Validations (in execution order)\n\n**A. Before the method body runs**\n\n1. **Authorization** \u2014 `@PreAuthorize(\"hasRole(@roles.OWNER_ADMIN)\")`. Non-admins are rejected first.\n2. **Bean Validation on the request DTO** (`OwnerFieldsDto`, via `@Valid @RequestBody` + class-level `@Validated`). A failure here returns 400 before any controller code runs:\n   - `firstName` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..30)`, `@Pattern` (letters, with up to 2 spaces/`'`/`-` groups)\n   - `lastName` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..30)`, `@Pattern` (same, trailing `.` allowed)\n   - `address` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..255)`\n   - `city` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..80)`\n   - `telephone` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..20)`\n   - `email` \u2014 `@Size(1..255)` (optional)\n   - `postcode` \u2014 `@Pattern(\"^[0-9]{4}$\")` (optional)\n\n**B. Manual checks inside the controller body (source order)**\n\n3. `validateRequiredOwnerFields` \u2192 `MissingOwnerFieldsException` if firstName/lastName/address/city/telephone are blank.\n4. `rejectFutureRegistrationDate` \u2192 `InvalidOwnerFieldsException([\"registrationDate\"])` if the supplied date is after today.\n5. *(computes effective date = supplied-or-`today`, rolled forward off weekends \u2014 see side-effects)*\n6. `rejectDailyLimitExceeded` \u2192 `OwnerDailyLimitExceededException` if \u2265 100 owners already registered on that business day.\n7. `rejectCityAtCapacity` \u2192 `OwnerCityCapacityExceededException` if the city already has \u2265 50 owners.\n8. *(DTO \u2192 `Owner` mapping happens here)*\n9. `validatePostcode` \u2192 `InvalidOwnerFieldsException([\"postcode\"])` if postcode present but not 4 digits or outside allowed region ranges (NSW 2000\u20132099, VIC 3000\u20133099, QLD 4000\u20134099).\n10. `normalizeTelephone` / `validateNationalNumberLength` \u2192 `InvalidOwnerFieldsException([\"telephone\"])` if not valid E.164 or wrong national length (+61 \u2192 9 digits, +1 \u2192 10).\n11. `applyHousehold` \u2192 `DuplicateOwnerHouseholdException` if the (lastName, postcode) household already exists and `sharesHousehold` is not `true`.\n12. `normalizeEmail` \u2192 `InvalidOwnerFieldsException([\"email\"])` if malformed or on the disposable-domain blocklist (mailinator.com, tempmail.com, guerrillamail.com).\n13. `rejectDuplicateIdentity` \u2192 `DuplicateOwnerIdentityException` if identity key `telephone|email|householdId` matches an existing owner.\n\n## Side-effects (in execution order)\n\n14. **Effective registration date computed** \u2014 supplied date or `LocalDate.now()`, then `toBusinessDay` rolls weekends forward to Monday.\n15. **DTO mapped to `Owner`** entity (`ownerMapper.toOwner`; id and pets not mapped, so id stays null \u2192 persist path).\n16. **Address normalized & set** \u2014 trim, collapse whitespace, uppercase, expand ST\u2192STREET/RD\u2192ROAD/AVE\u2192AVENUE.\n17. **Telephone normalized & set** \u2014 canonical E.164 form.\n18. **`householdId` set** (`applyHousehold`) \u2014 deterministic SHA-256 of `lastName|postcode` (12 hex chars) when postcode present.\n19. **Email normalized & set** \u2014 lowercased, or null.\n20. **`possibleDuplicate` / `possibleDuplicateOf` set** (`applyPossibleDuplicate`) \u2014 soft-match flags against lowest-id match.\n21. **`registrationDate` set** to the computed business day.\n22. **`customerCode` set** \u2014 `<REGION>-<HASH8>` (region from postcode/city, SHA-256 of telephone + lastName).\n23. **`membershipNumber` set** \u2014 `<customerCode>-M<YY>`.\n24. **`namesakeCount` set** \u2014 count of existing owners with the same first + last name.\n25. **Persisted** \u2014 `clinicService.saveOwner(owner)` \u2192 `ownerRepository.save` \u2192 `em.persist` inside a `@Transactional` write; id assigned on commit.\n26. **Audit log** \u2014 dedicated `AUDIT` logger emits one INFO line: id, customerCode, registrationDate, membershipLevel.\n27. **Response DTO built** \u2014 `toOwnerDto` sets transient `householdMemberCount` and MapStruct derives `displayName`, `initials`, `locality`; `bulkSignupWarning` set (true when > 80 owners today).\n28. **`Location` header** set to `/api/owners/{id}`; returns **201 CREATED**.\n\n## Notes worth flagging\n\n- The `Owner` entity carries its own constraints (`@NotEmpty` on firstName/lastName/address/city/telephone, and a stricter `@Pattern` requiring E.164 `^\\+[0-9]{8,15}$` on telephone), but **these are never re-validated in this flow** \u2014 there's no `@Valid` at persist time and the mapper builds the entity directly. Enforcement effectively comes from the DTO constraints plus the manual controller checks.\n- No password encoding, email sending, event publishing, role assignment, or `@PrePersist` timestamping occurs for owners \u2014 none of that exists in this path."
